            "name": "title",
            "textbox_spec": "# Agent operations\nRequests, latency and quality of the World Bank agent, pipeline job health, and audit events on `wb_demo`. Refreshed by the `wb_ops` job from MLflow traces, the Jobs API, the model registry and `system.access.audit`."
          }
